  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In plotting stress versus strain curves for two materials <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi></math> , a student by mistake puts strain on the <math><mi>y</mi></math> -axis and stress on the <math><mi>x</mi></math> - axis as shown in the figure. Then the correct statement(s) is(are)<br ><br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image20-c0028362-b78e-4302-8e8f-bc17d47dc439.jpg\"/></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Am1aH",
      "text": "<math><mi>P</mi></math>  has more tensile strength than  <math><mi>Q</mi></math>",
